WEBVTT

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:54.380
As you can see, these are the children of BEGA.
Brought in from all over the world.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:02:00.020
Well? Do you see any
Bladers who catch your eye?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.220
Who is he?

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.960
Good eye.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.260
He is Brooklyn.
BEGA's secret weapon.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.530
What did you
want to talk about?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:27.850
This is Hitoshi Kinomiya.
He will be your personal coach.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:29.800
It's a pleasure, Brooklyn.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.650
It's nice to meet you,
Coach Kinomiya.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.970
It's all busted up!

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.160
It's quite damaged...

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:59.820
I don't think
it can be repaired.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:05.260
No kidding. Normally we would
have changed parts a long time ago.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.970
I'll just have to wait for
Kyoujyu to make a new one.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:25.450
I've completed
inputting the basic data.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:31.760
But I'll need new parts if I want
to make something from scratch.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.730
Calm down, Takao!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.680
Panicking won't do
us any good!

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:41.130
I know! But it really
drives me nuts!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.890
Screw this!

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:45.780
I'm gonna go give Volkov
a knuckle sandwich!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.620
Daichi!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.200
Don't stop me, Sensei!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.730
I'm off!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.300
Ow...

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.010
Watch where
you're walking, hag!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.610
Shut up!
Speak for yourself!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:11.330
Jeez! Of all the
rotten luck today!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.660
What's got you so mad?
Did something happen?

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.180
Yes!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:22.020
You don't have a BEGA ID?

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.580
Then you can't
be our friend!

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:28.450
But I...

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:32.080
You big baby! We're headed
straight for the pros!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.770
This isn't just kids' stuff!

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:37.780
If you wanna roll with us,
go get an ID card!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.130
But...

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.300
What's going on here?

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:45.320
You think you
bullies can go pro?

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.420
Get a load of this weirdo!

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.570
Run!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.900
They're all obsessed
over these stupid IDs!

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.460
Everyone's going crazy
over this pro stuff...

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.370
That probably means
Volkov's plan is sinking in.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.600
Not on my watch, Volkov!

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:12.130
We're gonna crush your plans!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.770
Go, Shoot!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.010
Go, Shoot straight to your heart!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:34.500
I hope you've
signed up for an ID!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.300
Let's improve together!

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:43.730
That was Ming-Ming's
new commercial!

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.620
You're incredible.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:52.700
Fighting as a pro Beyblader and working
as a pop star at the same time...

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.900
It's really tough!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:58.800
But I love Beyblading and
work, so it's all okay!

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:03.840
And I've got a really important match coming up! I'm gonna do my best!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:09.290
So are you going to
dedicate yourself to practicing?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:12.960
I am! All the blood,
sweat, and tears!

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.440
Get back up,
Ming-Ming!

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.700
I'm going to
work my hardest!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.900
Shoot!

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:24.170
So are you working on some
kind of special move?

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:28.060
Oh, no!
That's top secret!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:37.340
She's popular with young
girls up to college age.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:43.160
Even people who weren't interested
in Beyblade are signing up for IDs.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.660
Great.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:49.240
Increasing the number of players is the
key to invigorating Beyblade as a whole.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.420
It's more effective than we
ever could have imagined.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:58.900
I think she should be a representative,
even if it means losing a match.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.690
Losing?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:07.860
Come, now. Did you think I called
her in just to appease the crowds?

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:31.850
You're not getting away.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.440
Go, Venus!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.180
She is...

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:53.330
A BEGA Blader.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.460
Who's up next?

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.410
What's the status on Mystel?

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.170
Go, Shoot!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:43.980
His exhibition match in New York was
much more successful than expected.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.480
He's popular with a
variety of companies.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.090
Requests from
sponsors are flooding in!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:53.770
Now we've got funds to
build a New York office.

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:56.600
We'll need Mystel to
work even harder.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.290
Well, sir...

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.820
What is it?

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:07.120
I'm sorry. Mystel has gone
missing in the blink of an eye...

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:10.090
Again? What will
we do with him...

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:15.440
We're doing everything in our power to find him, but as for his whereabouts...

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.050
No matter.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:19.420
Let him do what he wants.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.570
But sir...

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:29.810
He's like the wind.
You can't keep him on a leash.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.850
He'll be back before
the tournament.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.930
Are you okay, Moses?

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:42.330
The tournament is soon, isn't it?
You need to practice lots...

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.940
Don't worry about me.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:48.740
Just focus on getting
healthy, Monica.

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:52.650
But your opponents are
really strong, right?

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.940
But so am I!

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.850
Gigars...!

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:17.060
They are strong.
Very strong.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.220
But I won't lose to them!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:26.740
I'll never lose! Even if I'm up against the world champion. Or even the universe champion!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.530
Universe?
You're so funny.

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:33.000
Really? Funny...

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.090
Here, Moses.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.410
What is...

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:42.200
A good luck charm.
It's not that good though...

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.140
Good luck, Moses.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:53.880
I'll do my best
to get better too.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:57.220
I'll be rooting for you.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.080
You're crying again.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:07.570
I'm not crying, Monica!

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:10.580
I'm not...

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.020
You're such a crybaby!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.240
I'm not crying!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.300
Hey, look.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.970
Garland's having
a practice match.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.000
Against who?

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.370
Moses and Mystel
aren't here, so...

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:49.490
It's the newbie. Kai Hiwatari,
the former Neo-Borg member.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:54.770
I don't know much about Neo-Borg, but he's
got guts for thinking he's a match for Garland...

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.290
Go, Shoot!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:05.920
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:12.160
No way! The newbie's
got Garland on the ropes!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.600
If this keeps up...

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:17.370
Garland would never lose.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.980
He's gonna turn it around!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.180
Maybe...

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.010
Is that it...

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.540
I can tell from one attack
that he's on a different level!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.020
Much stronger than
I was imagining.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:27.060
You saw right
through my attack.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.160
You're good, Kai Hiwatari.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.480
Not everyone can survive
in a duel against me.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.560
But you're holding back.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.940
Am I right?

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.650
And so are you.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:20.050
Galaxy Turbo Twister!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.620
This is it.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.410
The angle of his right elbow.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:26.100
And the instant adjustment
he makes to his shoulders.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:30.340
This is the moment where
delicate control is paramount.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.280
And next is...

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:37.240
Where he widens the angle of his
stance for a more powerful shoot...

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.500
What's up?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:44.290
Isn't it a waste to stay coddled up
in this room on such a nice day?

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.060
I'm going outside.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.840
We'll do practical drills next.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.400
You can play outside
as much as you like.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.680
No thanks.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:52.730
What?

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:57.320
I'll be fine. I get the
gist of your theories.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.660
Brooklyn, wait.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.160
See you later.

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:03.620
He's a real handful...

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:11.420
Wake up, Brooklyn.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.520
Time for practical drills. Get up.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:19.480
Oh dear.
You got me.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.920
I can't believe it.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:32.380
I see. That coach is special.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.640
What do you mean?

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:37.570
Brooklyn has never
practiced a day in his life.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:44.100
He's gone through plenty of coaches,
but none have been able to motivate him.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.760
That's not funny.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.680
Do you think I'm joking?

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:52.090
No. A little
more to the right.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.770
Don't move your arms.
Use your shoulders.

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:55.970
Like this?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.780
A little more to the right.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:58.980
Right there!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:04.420
Well? I bet it's not quite
like what you had in mind.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.810
True.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.200
You learn from experience.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:11.620
There are some things you just don't know until you try them.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:15.360
There's a whole world you can
only reach outside your head.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.890
Yeah, coach.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:20.290
Try shooting.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.770
At the rock?

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:22.650
Yes.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.400
Don't forget that feeling!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.180
What kind of power was that?!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.500
He's in a completely
different dimension.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:49.850
He's a genius.
A Beyblading prodigy.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.330
A Beyblading prodigy?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.900
There's no one in the
world who can beat him.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.620
Including me.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:02.500
I could hardly even call
that a good match.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:05.820
I'm surprised that you'd
admit defeat so easily.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:09.740
No hard feelings,
but stay away from him.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:18.960
How's this? I changed it to
fit my style a little better.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:21.620
This gives it a
little more power.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:26.360
He had this powerful
of a shot after one try...

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.220
He's talented!

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.380
This was a good
learning experience.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:33.940
I'll be looking forward
to learning more, coach.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.440
You're putting on
quite the show.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.040
Show?
What do you mean?

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:00.000
Don't play dumb. You joined BEGA
to help Kinomiya, didn't you?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:05.850
You're raising a powerful rival so that
Kinomiya can grow even stronger.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.610
Because that's exactly
what you'd do.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:18.050
Is Brooklyn a Blader worthy of making
you go through all that trouble?

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:22.940
Well, Hitoshi Kinomiya?

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:26.700
Just wait and see.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.090
Things are going
to start picking up.

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.700
I'll say this.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:40.180
Anyone who gets in
the way of my goal...

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:42.730
Will be crushed
without mercy.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:47.490
I thought I told you
to stay away from him.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.920
I don't take advice
from sore losers.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:53.690
You'll end up a loser,
just like me. Face the facts.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:57.340
If you don't accept that,
you'll never improve.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:21:00.970
And yet I'm not
letting it end here.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:04.250
I will surpass him one day!

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:08.780
For my Blader pride.
For the glory of the Siebald name!

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.300
I vow it.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:13.180
Just remember this!

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.450
If you carelessly
mess with Brooklyn...

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.040
You'll be sent to hell!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:24.320
Brooklyn...
Just who in the hell...

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.080
Is he?

00:22:56.010 --> 00:23:01.120
Thanks for waiting!
We finally finished the new Beys!

00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:04.280
Higher rotation, higher speed,
higher power than ever before!

00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:07.360
But since I designed it
to be so high spec...

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:10.660
Are you saying we aren't
strong enough? Don't worry!

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:15.700
We've been training for this day to come!
Let's see what this baby can do!

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:19.200
What is this? Could it be
the BBA's ultimate weapon?

00:23:20.280 --> 00:23:21.930
Holy crap!
